{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55711","headline":"春日登大悲阁二首（一字至七字） 二 · 钱惟治","name":"春日登大悲阁二首（一字至七字） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阁，阁。\n般斤，郢作。\n木从绳，工必度。\n华饰藻绘，密施榱桷。\n明蟾代宝灯，瑞霭爲珍箔。\n栏危似倚高空，梯迥疑穿碧落。\n有时闲上瞰人寰，自谓禽中腾一鹗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱惟治","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55711.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55711","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}